      "text": "あはは！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈が笑っていると、彩愛さんが湯呑みを手に休憩室へ入ってきた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "何やら楽しそうなお話ですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あ、彩愛さん！　駅前でビールフェスやるんですって！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
